  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_9943.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(18 fotos) Ha tenido lugar la tarde de este viernes, 2 de agosto, en el paseo central de la calle Joan Fuster, entre El Cant&oacute; y el Caf&eacute; Colonial, que estaba repleto de gente durante las dos horas que ha durado el concierto del grupo flamenquito DeAlma.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9917.jpg\" alt=\"img_9917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9922.jpg\" alt=\"img_9922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9924.jpg\" alt=\"img_9924\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9926.jpg\" alt=\"img_9926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9928.jpg\" alt=\"img_9928\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9931.jpg\" alt=\"img_9931\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9932.jpg\" alt=\"img_9932\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9933.jpg\" alt=\"img_9933\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealmacolonial/img_9935.jpg\" alt=\"img_9935\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tardeodealm